flowchart TB
    SCHEDULE["Pi / Prefect<br/>Weekdays 17:30 New York"] -.-> PI["Lightweight archive worker<br/>Stream directly to verified NAS mount"]
    ORACLE["Oracle compactor<br/>Closed + verified quote partitions"] -->|Read-only private link| PI
    PI --> OBJECTS[("NAS content-addressed objects<br/>New or changed files only")]
    OBJECTS --> VERIFY["NAS local reread<br/>SHA-256 + size + manifest"]
    VERIFY --> SNAPSHOT["Publish immutable snapshot<br/>Quote lineage + safe policy settings"]
    WEEKEND["Pi / Prefect<br/>Saturday 10:00 Shanghai"] -.-> PIN["Laptop /srv/research<br/>Pin data + policy + code identity"]
    SNAPSHOT --> PIN
    IMAGE["Cloud-built AMD64 image<br/>Matching archived code version"] --> PIN
    PIN --> REPLAY["Isolated current-strategy replay<br/>Causal quotes · separate RTH / GTH"]
    REPLAY --> RESULTS["Local results + logs + manifests<br/>Keep gaps and failed outcomes"]
    RESULTS --> BACKUP["NAS result backup + local verification<br/>Retry pending backups"]
    BACKUP --> RECEIPT["Verified receipt + retained local copy<br/>No new Oracle deletion rule"]
    class ORACLE live
    class SCHEDULE,PI,WEEKEND control
    class OBJECTS,VERIFY,SNAPSHOT,PIN,RESULTS,BACKUP,RECEIPT store
    class IMAGE,REPLAY cloud

    classDef cloud fill:#e9f2ff,stroke:#477bb5,color:#173a61
    classDef live fill:#e4f5f0,stroke:#378c77,color:#153f35
    classDef control fill:#f0eaff,stroke:#9272c5,color:#3f2f60
    classDef store fill:#fff4d9,stroke:#b89335,color:#5a4513
    classDef warn fill:#fff0ec,stroke:#c77b62,color:#713f30
